"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.http.cors.access-control-allow-credentials+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "The `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` response header."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tells browsers if front-end JavaScript can be allowed to access credentials when the request's credentials mode, `Request.credentials`, is set to `include`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Default: `true` if the `quarkus.http.cors.origins` property is set and matches the precise `Origin` header value."
